[[Headmaster Vhang]] is the headmaster for [[Elementalists]] at the [[Shing Jea Monastery]]. Headmaster Vhang is the youngest headmaster the Shing Jea Monastery has ever had, a fact that makes him more than a little arrogant. He is available as a [[henchman]] in [[Kaineng City]].

He is labeled as a [[Shock Henchman]].

