==Dialogue==
Shing Jea Monastery (to [[Guild Wars Factions|Factions]] [[elementalist]] characters):
:''"Greetings! I am Headmaster Vhang, the most recently promoted and far and away the youngest of the headmasters here at the monastery. To reach this lofty position, I mastered the skills of an Elementalist in just a few short years, scored perfectly on every Elementalist test, and single-handedly smote the infamous [[The Bog Beast of Bokku (NPC)|Bog Beast of Bokku]]. You are fortunate, indeed, for you will be training directly with me."''

Shing Jea Monastery (to Factions non-elementalist characters):
:''"Because you are not an Elementalist, it is inconceivable that you might ever achieve the power I hold in even the smallest of my fingers. However, you can at least tell everyone you know that you have met me. Congratulations!"''

Shing Jea Monastery (to foreign characters):
:''"I am afraid I cannot help you. You are not a student here. And do not bother trying to become one... that honor is reserved for Canthans."''

Zen Daijun mission:
:''"The Master has asked me to accompany him on this important assignment. Of course, I am not surprised; I am the youngest ever to have mastered all of the elements, a feat for which I was promoted to headmaster. As long as I am here, [Character Name], you need not fret for your safety."''

Kaineng City town and outposts:
:''"Not many people are lucky enough to go on an adventure with me. I'm sure you'll treasure this journey for the rest of your life. If you're lucky, maybe I'll save a few of our enemies for you to destroy so you can join in the glory."''

:''"What did you need me to do for you?"''

Divine Path:
:''"No need to thank me. I know you could not have done it without me."''

